ition-delay:0s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0s, transform 0s ease-out 0s\"><h2 class=\"text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink\">What <!-- -->Jallal Properties<!-- --> does</h2></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><p class=\"text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-muted\">Connecting private individuals, multinational corporations and diaspora investors with prime residential, industrial and commercial real estate solutions across Sierra Leone&#x27;s high-growth corridors.</p></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.2\" style=\"transition-delay:0.2s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.2s, transform 0s ease-out 0.2s\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Real estate and property services connecting individuals and enterprises with modern housing, commercial space and transparent land solutions.<!-- --> Engagements are delivered with the group&#x27;s shared governance, security and delivery standards, and are supported by the group&#x27;s technical, commercial and talent capabilities.</p></div></div><aside class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-forest p-6 text-white lg:col-span-5\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Strategic mandate</span><p class=\"mt-3 text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-dark\">“<!-- -->Modernizing property management, title diligence and transparent asset acquisition with strict governance standards.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-headline-sm font-bold text-lime\">$18M+</span><span class=\"label-caps text-on-dark-muted\">Asset transactions</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-headline-sm font-bold text-lime\">100%</span><span class=\"label-caps text-on-dark-muted\">Verified land records</span></div></div></aside></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-line bg-white py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0\" style=\"transition-delay:0s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0s, transform 0s ease-out 0s\"><h2 class=\"text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink\">Core capabilities</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8 reveal-group grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-all\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house lucide-home h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Residential brokerage</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Curated portfolios of verified villas, suburban apartments and diaspora home-ownership packages.</p></article><article class=\"hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 hover:border-accent/40 transition-all\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building-complex lucide-building-2 h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 12h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 8h4\"></path><path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\"></path><path d=\"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 